neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jWjqVWNOSOAQ7kNvwFsyzJ8&_nc_oc=AdnWGTgEfQCHf-DI6WhLFYAG9j7A9cLyV0IPiw7OP4c9r0O4_pO0xAPeNV-5ucy4KCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfteNfdWu7AsV7c48Cvj4TrnU_10RyM4VocafHbf9rxOlA&oe=69A6C474"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VM-SVuZXvFYQ7kNvwGVSFrw&_nc_oc=AdlAC9u2ygOTqP6WgbLvARzszSTss6gUdoAuKM1cmnU_khPMf4KWVfbbQpdtscGVA1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfupANFtNoS6kHNn3tmhiSGOuS1aGwnBJdJDJOXgFCMnKQ&oe=69A6C5D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dwCj0WbI-DQQ7kNvwHIGTh7&_nc_oc=Admq7naX3OdSADNS_Dm7LXpv0WVtZXzGh5f9gR3ks85To4OhVThfuA0El7z1yXJHOkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftFKwRS_r5PzeTrZhUR4UHnl_o9blQGCG4tzAOI_xcTFA&oe=69A6DAF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_